133
00:06:52,480 --> 00:07:04,310
Well shock is something, especially anaphylactic shock, which means that I think you stop breathing because your body basically shuts down and your throat tightens so you can't breathe.

134
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:09,330
But to go into shock means that your body will kind of stop doing its normal functions.

135
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:15,010
For example, if you fall in very, very, very cold water, your body goes into shock.

136
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:20,420
And this is something that is a physical reaction.

137
